msgstr "Opdag synlighed forudindstillet felter"

#: incl/mcp/presets.php:18
msgid ""
"Discover native visibility preset rule types, fields and choices. Rules "
"within a set use AND; sets use OR. Read a saved preset with "
"list-control-presets before changing it."
msgstr ""
"Opdag indfødte synlighed forudindstillet regeltyper, felter og valg. Regler "
"inden for et sæt bruger AND; sæt bruger OR. Læs en gemt forudindstilling "
"med list-control-presets før du ændrer den."

#: incl/mcp/presets.php:25
msgid "Create or update visibility preset"
msgstr "Opret eller opdater synlighed forudindstilling"

#: incl/mcp/presets.php:26
msgid ""
"Create a named visibility preset or update an existing ID. Supplied "
"controlSets replace that preset definition; omitted title or controlSets "
"are preserved on update. This does not automatically attach the preset to "
"post blocks."
msgstr ""
"Opret en navngivet synlighed forudindstilling eller opdater en eksisterende "
"ID. Leverede controlSets erstatter den forudindstilling definition; "
"udeladte titel eller controlSets bevares ved opdatering. Dette vedhæfter "
"ikke automatisk forudindstillingen til postblokke."

#: incl/mcp/presets.php:36
msgid "Delete visibility preset"
msgstr "Slet synlighed forudindstilling"

#: incl/mcp/presets.php:37
msgid ""
"Delete a verified saved visibility preset ID. Existing post references are "
"not rewritten. Read its usage before deleting."
msgstr ""
"Slet en verificeret gemt synlighed forudindstilling ID. Eksisterende "
"posthenvisninger bliver ikke omskrevet. Læs dens anvendelse før du sletter."

